[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     63[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   multi-block, and a length > one keccak/blake block;
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     64[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `inblocks`: `0`, `1`, `2`, `SPX_FORS_TREES`, `SPX_WOTS_LEN`;
